{"text": "Ani's teacher gives every child a small pot with a seed in it. 'Water it a little every day and put it in the sun,' she says. At home, Ani puts the pot on the kitchen window. For a week nothing happens, and Ani feels sad. Then one morning she sees a tiny green leaf! Every day the plant grows a little taller. Ani learns an important lesson: good things need time. Now she writes the plant's height in her notebook every Sunday.", "words": [[0.48, 0.86], [0.96, 1.38], [1.86, 2.06], [2.2, 2.42], [2.52, 2.94], [3.0, 3.03], [3.14, 3.48], [3.56, 3.9], [4.24, 4.36], [4.4, 4.43], [4.56, 4.9], [4.96, 5.06], [5.12, 5.26], [5.46, 7.06], [7.12, 7.22], [7.3, 7.33], [7.4, 7.64], [7.8, 8.04], [8.14, 8.42], [8.82, 8.94], [9.0, 9.18], [9.22, 9.3], [9.36, 9.42], [9.44, 9.52], [9.66, 10.38], [10.42, 10.5], [10.62, 11.0], [12.36, 12.5], [12.6, 12.96], [13.32, 13.54], [13.66, 13.9], [13.96, 14.04], [14.1, 14.4], [14.76, 14.82], [14.86, 14.94], [15.0, 15.4], [15.5, 15.92], [17.38, 17.5], [17.54, 17.57], [17.68, 17.9], [18.1, 18.44], [18.56, 19.14], [19.56, 19.66], [19.74, 19.96], [20.1, 20.42], [20.52, 20.96], [22.34, 22.52], [22.66, 22.8], [22.86, 23.28], [23.74, 23.82], [23.96, 24.2], [24.26, 24.29], [24.42, 24.82], [25.0, 25.32], [25.42, 25.76], [27.22, 27.48], [27.6, 27.86], [28.06, 28.16], [28.22, 28.62], [28.84, 29.2], [29.28, 29.31], [29.36, 29.58], [29.7, 30.16], [31.56, 31.78], [31.92, 32.4], [32.56, 32.62], [32.66, 33.26], [33.36, 33.76], [34.28, 34.42], [34.5, 34.86], [35.0, 35.24], [35.38, 35.86], [37.26, 37.48], [37.58, 37.68], [37.74, 38.04], [38.08, 38.18], [38.22, 38.66], [38.74, 39.04], [39.26, 39.32], [39.36, 39.46], [39.56, 40.04], [40.44, 40.68], [40.82, 41.542]], "tag": "kokoro:bm_george", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}